  "description": "Database-level data masking engine: schema discovery, masking profiles, script generation, execution, audit log and an EF Core backed configuration store. Add a provider package (SqlServer, Oracle, MySql, PostgreSql) and optionally StingrayDbMasking.Blazor for the UI.",
